node_modules/
dist/
.turbo/
*.log
.DS_Store
coverage/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Anchored to the repo root: a top-level local-data dir (sqlite files, dumps).
# Unanchored `data/` also matched `apps/server/src/routes/data/` — the CRUD
# route source — and silently kept it out of version control.
/data/
# The dashboard build copied into the published package at prepack
# (apps/server/scripts/bundle-dashboard.mjs) — generated, never committed.
/apps/server/dashboard/
# The LLM allow-lists snapshotted into the published package at prepack
# (apps/server/scripts/bundle-allowlists.mjs) — derived from the @adminium/widgets
# registries at build time, so committing it would be a second copy free to rot.
/apps/server/vocabulary/
# Astro's generated type/content cache for @adminium/docs. Regenerated by
# `astro check`/`astro build`; committing it produces churn on every build.
/apps/docs/.astro/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
scripts/release/out/
